+
+  RIPPS2 build 80: STATUS (main menu, where ACHIEVEMENTS was; that page moved to Settings). The homebrew
+  RIPPS2 carries, each under its own name: where it is installed now, a way to install the copy RIPPS2
+  carries, and the settings for it that live elsewhere in the menus, gathered here so nobody has to know
